    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1502740045": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -633738341,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Maybe grab some land, get a farm or somethin’. Someplace quiet. No traffic, no smog, no one breathing down my neck.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-596797620": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -633738341,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Can’t say I’d be a good farmer, but I’d figure it out. Worst case? I just own a bunch of animals and let ‘em do whatever. Sounds kinda nice, actually.",
