    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "106046473": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1375336227,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Like, I could probably compete professionally if that was a thing. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-248900247": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1375336227,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Some people meditate, some go to therapy—me? I take stupidly long naps and hope life sorts itself out while I’m unconscious.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2100609836": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1375336227,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "And if I’m not actually sleeping, I’m daydreaming. Just thinking about all the ways my life could’ve gone.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1583535404": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1375336227,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Then I wake up, and—poof! Still here. Guess that’s just how it goes.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
